//
// Behavior:
// - Receives TEST_START/TEST_STOP from Cube over ESP-NOW.
// - Replies immediately with ROGER.
// - Sends STATUS periodically while test is running.
// - Yellow LED = "latched filtered presence": turns OFF only if filtered presence has been lost > 5s (hard-coded).
// - Green LED  = SUCCESS: turns ON after required held time (from Cube), based on filtered presence.
// - Held time pauses during brief losses; resets if loss lasts > 5s (hard-coded).
//
// IMPORTANT:
// - ESPNOW_CHANNEL must match Cube.
// - We do NOT expose loss_grace_ms or dist_stale_ms to the user (hard-coded).

